  "prefLabel": "Env-A 2001.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 2001.01 Purpose. The purpose of this chapter is to establish emission standards for particulate matter and visible emissions from stationary fuel burning devices pursuant to RSA 125-C:6, II.\n\nSource. #6505-B, eff 5-1-97 (formerly Env-A 1202); ss by #8331, eff 4-23-05; ss by #10416, eff 9-24-13; ss by #13809, eff 11-18-23",
